1
00:00:05,260 --> 00:00:06,980
我来给你擦 老公
Let me get that, husband.

2
00:00:09,460 --> 00:00:10,980
在经历了状况频出的婚礼
After a storybook wedding

3
00:00:10,980 --> 00:00:12,520
和梦幻的蜜月之后
and a magical honeymoon,

4
00:00:12,740 --> 00:00:14,820
米奇尔和我终于喜结连理
Mitchell and I are finally newlyweds.

5
00:00:15,120 --> 00:00:16,200
你不觉得坐在你自己的椅子上
Are you sure you wouldn't be more comfortable

6
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:16,780
更舒服一点吗
in your own chair?

7
00:00:17,040 --> 00:00:19,320
别再说什么"你的""我的"了
There's no more "My chair" Or "Your chair."

8
00:00:20,360 --> 00:00:23,380
几星期前 我们度完蜜月回来
So we got back from our honeymoon several weeks ago,

9
00:00:23,540 --> 00:00:25,120
感觉就像还未...
and it feels like it never --

10
00:00:25,120 --> 00:00:25,800
还未结束吗 老天呐
Never ended? Oh, my gosh.

11
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:28,080
感觉我们同心同德
It's like we have one mind and one heart.

12
00:00:28,120 --> 00:00:29,100
还同椅
And one chair.

13
00:00:31,720 --> 00:00:33,380
结婚三周月纪念日快乐
Happy three-month anniversary.

14
00:00:33,620 --> 00:00:34,580
是今天吗
Oh, is that today?

15
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:37,960
我们公司今天有个无聊的鸡尾酒会
So, listen, I have this boring cocktail thing at the office,

16
00:00:37,960 --> 00:00:39,120
但我应该六点就能到家了
but I should be home by 6:00,

17
00:00:39,120 --> 00:00:40,480
然后我们可以直接去参加派对
and then we can head to the party.

18
00:00:41,520 --> 00:00:44,440
给你的 小爸 大爸送的 又来了
For you, dad. From dad. Again.

19
00:00:44,440 --> 00:00:46,363
花吗 但你昨天刚送花给我了呀
Flowers? But you just got me flowers yesterday.

20
00:00:46,363 --> 00:00:48,653
你昨天早餐也吃了麦片啊
Well, you also had cereal yesterday.

21
00:00:48,653 --> 00:00:50,660
我不介意今天可以再吃一点
And I wouldn't mind having some today.

22
00:00:51,080 --> 00:00:53,820
怀念以前家里没这么多蜜蜂的时候
Sure was nice when this house wasn't full of bees.

23
00:01:08,470 --> 00:01:10,060
女士要再来点糖浆吗
More syrup for milady?

24
00:01:10,060 --> 00:01:11,720
何乐而不为 谢谢 您真好
Why, thank you, kind sir.

25
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:14,600
克莱尔 你和卢克做的曲奇饼还有吗
Claire, do we still have any of those cookies that you and Luke baked?

26
00:01:14,760 --> 00:01:17,960
我们是那种拿曲奇饼当早餐的家庭吗
Are we the kind of family that has cookies for breakfast?

27
00:01:18,620 --> 00:01:20,020
当然 我们就是
Yes, we are!

28
00:01:20,020 --> 00:01:22,180
好耶 好耶
Yeah! Yeah!

29
00:01:25,080 --> 00:01:25,820
有蝴蝶
A butterfly!

30
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:26,880
天呐
Oh, my god!

31
00:01:27,360 --> 00:01:28,560
我们度过了
We are having...

32
00:01:28,560 --> 00:01:30,460
有史以来最完美的
...the most perfect summer...

33
00:01:30,460 --> 00:01:30,940
夏天
...ever.

34
00:01:31,580 --> 00:01:32,260
别误会
Don't get me wrong,

35
00:01:32,260 --> 00:01:34,240
邓菲家的生活还是很欢乐的
the Dunphys have had some great days.

36
00:01:34,240 --> 00:01:36,140
只是这种时光总是断断续续的
We just have a little trouble stringing them together.

37
00:01:36,300 --> 00:01:38,840
我们的最好纪录是连续八天的幸福日子
Our record was eight consecutive blissful days --

38
00:01:38,940 --> 00:01:40,440
那是在2007年12月
December 2007.

39
00:01:40,680 --> 00:01:41,620
简直是我们的光明节
It was our Hanukkah.

40
00:01:41,620 --> 00:01:44,820
这个夏天 邓菲家所有人都相处融洽
This summer, all the Dunphys are just clicking.

41
00:01:44,820 --> 00:01:46,720
没错 海莉和卢克和睦相处
Yeah, Haley and Luke are getting along,

42
00:01:46,880 --> 00:01:49,120
艾丽克斯去给穷人盖房子了
Alex is off building houses for the poor.

43
00:01:49,260 --> 00:01:51,420
我知道那听起来挺可怕的 但是她喜欢
Which I know sounds awful, but she loves it.

44
00:01:52,120 --> 00:01:54,160
我的时尚博客人气暴涨
My fashion blog is blowing up.

45
00:01:54,200 --> 00:01:56,060
我搞起了视频聊天秀
I started doing these live video chats,

46
00:01:56,060 --> 00:01:58,080
现在我的频道有五万多订阅者
and now I have over 50,000 subscribers!

47
00:01:58,860 --> 00:02:01,500
而且 我的头发状态好极了
Oh, plus, my hair has never looked better.

48
00:02:02,160 --> 00:02:03,640
我不信教
I'm not a religious person...

49
00:02:04,080 --> 00:02:05,480
但我就是幡然醒悟了
but I just woke up.

50
00:02:06,480 --> 00:02:07,620
菲尔搞起了园艺
Phil has been gardening.

51
00:02:07,740 --> 00:02:09,700
而我也有时间跟朋友小聚 读读名著
I've had time to catch up and read the classics.

52
00:02:09,700 --> 00:02:11,071
那是在她不需要帮我完成
...when she isn't busy helping me

53
00:02:11,280 --> 00:02:13,200
我的魔镜消失魔术的时候
with my magic-mirror disappearing trick.

54
00:02:13,200 --> 00:02:15,540
我刚要说 突然之间 我爱上了魔术
I'm just gonna say it -- suddenly, I love magic.

55
00:02:15,920 --> 00:02:17,360
我才不管现在是不是中午
I don't care if it's the middle of the day.

56
00:02:17,360 --> 00:02:18,440
我只想把你关进箱子
I just want to put you in a box

57
00:02:18,525 --> 00:02:20,027
往你身上插"剑"
and stick swords in you.

58
00:02:21,519 --> 00:02:23,040
让这个夏天更加梦幻的是
If this summer wasn't magical enough,

59
00:02:23,040 --> 00:02:24,560
我都还没吃到过一个坏李子
I haven't had a single bad plum!

60
00:02:25,860 --> 00:02:26,740
天呐
Oh, my god!

61
00:02:27,805 --> 00:02:29,080
这个拉链呢
So, the zipper --

62
00:02:29,080 --> 00:02:30,200
天呐
oh, my god!

63
00:02:31,240 --> 00:02:32,890
天呐
Oh, my god!

64
00:02:44,711 --> 00:02:45,880
曼尼
Manny!

65
00:02:45,880 --> 00:02:47,060
曼尼
Manny!

66
00:02:47,060 --> 00:02:49,660
来 跟你的兄弟姐妹们聊聊
Come! Talk to your cousins!

67
00:02:53,920 --> 00:02:54,360
你们好
Hola!

68
00:02:54,360 --> 00:02:57,500
曼尼 你为什么把他们冻起来
Manny, why you freeze the Colombians?

69
00:02:57,720 --> 00:02:58,800
如果我跟其中一个聊起来
If I talk to one of them,

70
00:02:58,800 --> 00:03:00,100
我就得跟其他50个聊
I have to talk to 50 of them.

71
00:03:00,160 --> 00:03:01,940
就当作是生日礼物啊
Just do it as a birthday gift.

72
00:03:02,020 --> 00:03:02,820
你总是这样
You always do this.

73
00:03:02,820 --> 00:03:04,080
你的生日在下个星期呢
Your birthday's not till next week.

74
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:04,940
不是我的生日
Not mine.

75
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:07,480
今天是你萝莎丽奥婶婶82岁生日
It's aunt Rosario's 82nd birthday today.

76
00:03:07,780 --> 00:03:10,280
所以那些山羊才都戴着派对帽
That's why all the goats are wearing the party hats.

77
00:03:10,580 --> 00:03:11,020
你看
Look!

78
00:03:12,440 --> 00:03:12,880
曼尼
Manny!

79
00:03:13,640 --> 00:03:14,520
大家好
Hi, everyone.

80
00:03:17,720 --> 00:03:19,200
新眼镜是不是又漂亮又时髦
Pretty snazzy new cheaters, huh?

81
00:03:19,200 --> 00:03:19,800
才五块钱
Five bucks.

82
00:03:20,580 --> 00:03:21,760
很值 对吧
I know, right?!

83
00:03:22,280 --> 00:03:23,600
我老公年纪是比较大
My husband is an older man,

84
00:03:23,600 --> 00:03:25,400
但他还不是老头子
but he's not an old man.

85
00:03:25,698 --> 00:03:28,960
但穿上运动服 现在又戴上老花镜
But with the track suit and -- and now the glasses,

86
00:03:28,960 --> 00:03:31,300
他最近好像不再努力打扮了
it's like he just stopped trying lately.

87
00:03:31,880 --> 00:03:33,280
生活不能只求舒适啊
Comfort is not everything.

88
00:03:34,485 --> 00:03:37,835
成人礼后 我的脚趾就再没知觉了
My toes have been numb since my quinceanera.

89
00:03:37,835 --> 00:03:39,460
我们五点再去酒吧
We don't have to be at drinks till 5:00,

90
00:03:39,460 --> 00:03:40,460
我要去办点事
so I'm gonna run a few errands,

91
00:03:40,520 --> 00:03:41,740
戴眼镜去兜兜风
take these bad boys for a spin.

92
00:03:42,240 --> 00:03:45,160
杰 你为什么不穿我给你买的新衣服
Ay, Jay, why don't you wear that new outfit that I just got you?

93
00:03:45,160 --> 00:03:47,740
那条多余的拉链显得太花哨了
Uh, a little flashy, that extra zipper.

94
00:03:47,740 --> 00:03:48,900
就像一部没有目的地的楼梯
Like a staircase to nowhere.

95
00:03:48,900 --> 00:03:51,380
是啊 但会让你看起非常
Yeah, but it makes you look very --

96
00:03:51,380 --> 00:03:53,219
亲爱的 我很抱歉 掉在你脚趾上了
Honey, I'm so sorry. Right on your toes.

97
00:03:53,219 --> 00:03:55,740
没关系 你可以把公用电话砸我脚上
It's fine. You can drop a pay phone on my foot.

98
00:03:55,740 --> 00:03:57,220
我一点感觉也没有
I don't feel a thing anymore.

99
00:04:01,200 --> 00:04:03,620
现在 我可爱的助手来协助我了
And now, as my lovely assistant joins me,

100
00:04:03,660 --> 00:04:05,160
我要开始念咒语了
it's time to chant the incantation

101
00:04:05,160 --> 00:04:08,960
将这位美女送到第六次元
that will send this fair maiden into the sixth dimension.

102
00:04:08,960 --> 00:04:12,495
借梅林的帽子 格拉曼思雅的女巫之名
By the hat of Merlin, by the witches of Gramanthia,

103
00:04:12,495 --> 00:04:16,331
我们为您奉上精彩的表演 消失
we do make this offering to you -- be gone!

104
00:04:17,020 --> 00:04:18,520
成功了吗 我消失了吗
Did I do it? Did I disappear?

105
00:04:19,520 --> 00:04:21,120
差一点 露出了点头
Almost. Just a little bit of forehead.

106
00:04:21,320 --> 00:04:22,340
我可以再蹲低点
Oh, I can scrunch down.

107
00:04:22,440 --> 00:04:23,140
这就是热爱
There's love.

108
00:04:23,140 --> 00:04:24,360
你们好啊
Hey, guys.

109
00:04:24,360 --> 00:04:25,760
太贴心了 你把筛粉机带来了
Sweet! You brought the sifter.

110
00:04:26,807 --> 00:04:28,644
我可以做大黄派了
Now I can start my rhubarb pie.

111
00:04:28,644 --> 00:04:30,760
我能帮你摘大黄吗
Ooh, can I help pick the rhubarb?

112
00:04:30,760 --> 00:04:31,600
带路吧 小猫咪
Lead the way, kitten.

113
00:04:32,440 --> 00:04:33,320
有人要吃李子吗
Anybody want a plum?

114
00:04:33,420 --> 00:04:34,000
不用了
I'm good.

115
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:35,264
我给你拿瓶无醇啤酒
I'll grab you a roadie.

116
00:04:36,460 --> 00:04:38,380
这么问可能不太合适
There is no easy way to ask this,

117
00:04:38,380 --> 00:04:39,380
但你们这是嗑药了吗
but are you all high?

118
00:04:39,420 --> 00:04:40,500
才不是 米奇尔 我们很幸福
No, Mitchell. We're happy.

119
00:04:40,880 --> 00:04:42,420
我正在努力逃离幸福
Oh, I'm trying to get away from "Happy."

120
00:04:42,520 --> 00:04:44,520
好吧 用最简洁的方法
All right, in the briefest possible way,

121
00:04:44,520 --> 00:04:45,740
你直接告诉我是怎么回事吧
why don't you let me know what's going on?

122
00:04:45,740 --> 00:04:47,880
小卡拒绝结束蜜月
Okay, Cam refuses to let the honeymoon end.

123
00:04:47,880 --> 00:04:50,600
我收到了无数的花 和肉麻短信
I have a house full of flowers, endless romantic texts.

124
00:04:50,660 --> 00:04:52,660
我知道 我听起来像个不懂感恩的混蛋
I know, I know, I sound like an ungrateful jerk.

125
00:04:52,760 --> 00:04:53,380
是的
You do.

126
00:04:53,520 --> 00:04:54,280
累死人了
It's exhausting.

127
00:04:54,700 --> 00:04:56,860
更别提我完全无法给他对等的爱
Not to mention impossible to reciprocate.

128
00:04:57,000 --> 00:04:57,740
天呐
Oh, my god!

129
00:04:57,740 --> 00:04:58,620
总之
Um, anyway,

130
00:04:58,620 --> 00:05:00,760
你觉得我该不该跟他温柔地说下
do you think that maybe I should talk to him gently

131
00:05:00,760 --> 00:05:02,400
让他适可而止
about taking it down a notch?

132
00:05:02,420 --> 00:05:04,020
绝对不行 下场会很惨烈
No, absolutely not. That never ends well.

133
00:05:04,560 --> 00:05:06,180
显然你看成了"刻薄点"
Clearly you thought this said "Be mean."

134
00:05:06,180 --> 00:05:07,972
-菲尔 亲爱的 -不
- Phil, honey, no. - No.

135
00:05:07,972 --> 00:05:09,753
好吧 别担心 我...
It's -- okay, don't worry, I...

136
00:05:10,300 --> 00:05:11,960
那都不是情人节呢
And it wasn't even Valentine's Day.

137
00:05:11,960 --> 00:05:13,580
所以你的建议是按兵不动
So your advice is to do nothing.

138
00:05:13,980 --> 00:05:16,080
是的 米奇尔 虽然这听起来很可怕
Yes, Mitchell, as horrible as this sounds,

139
00:05:16,320 --> 00:05:19,400
但你得忍气吞声 让自己被他宠爱
you need to suck it up and let yourself be loved,

140
00:05:19,400 --> 00:05:22,160
小卡最后会降低浪漫程度的
and Cam will end up dialing back the romance.

141
00:05:22,640 --> 00:05:24,000
你可能还会怀念过去呢
You might just miss it.

142
00:05:24,220 --> 00:05:24,800
我就是
I know I do.

143
00:05:25,080 --> 00:05:26,760
好了 给我的小蜜桃一个李子
Here we are. A plum for my peach.

144
00:05:28,440 --> 00:05:29,320
是吗
Do you?

145
00:05:30,600 --> 00:05:31,120
给你
Here you go.

146
00:05:32,100 --> 00:05:32,980
谢谢
Thank you.

147
00:05:35,040 --> 00:05:35,660
他没事吧
Is he okay?

148
00:05:35,800 --> 00:05:36,500
他是米奇尔
He's Mitchell.

149
00:05:36,500 --> 00:05:38,000
我甚至都不想聊那事
Look, I didn't even want to talk about it.

150
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:40,420
咱家现在顺风顺水的
We've had such a great thing going on here.

151
00:05:40,420 --> 00:05:42,840
我可不想让那种负能量进屋
I don't want to let that kind of negativity in the house.

152
00:05:44,120 --> 00:05:44,560
艾丽克斯
Alex!

153
00:05:45,200 --> 00:05:47,160
我们以为你下周才回来呢
We didn't think you were coming back until next week.

154
00:05:47,240 --> 00:05:48,340
我提前回来了
I got a ride home early.

155
00:05:48,660 --> 00:05:50,180
这简直是最烂的夏天
This has been the worst summer ever!

156
00:05:51,020 --> 00:05:52,100
当心点 你个蠢货
Careful, you idiot!

157
00:05:52,240 --> 00:05:53,340
你才是蠢货
You're an idiot!

158
00:05:59,120 --> 00:06:00,720
昨晚我的帐篷坏了
And last night, my tent ripped,

159
00:06:00,800 --> 00:06:01,600
所以我不得不
so I had to sleep

160
00:06:01,600 --> 00:06:03,440
靠着一辆面包车睡在一块胶合板下面
under a plywood board leaning up against a van.

161
00:06:03,660 --> 00:06:04,360
递我一张纸巾吧
Pass me a napkin.

162
00:06:04,360 --> 00:06:06,260
夫人的胳膊断了吗
Is milady's arm broken?

163
00:06:06,260 --> 00:06:07,360
你的胳膊就要被我打断了
Yours is about to be.

164
00:06:07,360 --> 00:06:08,859
祖国珍贵的花朵
Aww, precious flowers.

165
00:06:08,859 --> 00:06:10,620
反正老鼠那么多 我也睡不着
Not that I could sleep with all the rats.

166
00:06:10,620 --> 00:06:10,980
顺便说一句
And, by the way,

167
00:06:11,080 --> 00:06:12,960
如果你们开始咳血 那是我的错
if any of you start coughing up blood, my bad.

168
00:06:13,060 --> 00:06:14,260
我觉得我带回了瘟疫
I think I brought back the plague.

169
00:06:14,720 --> 00:06:15,820
我在干嘛呢
What am I doing?

170
00:06:15,940 --> 00:06:17,600
我把书包忘在车道了
I think I left my backpack in the driveway.

171
00:06:18,440 --> 00:06:19,740
别踢我
Stop kicking me!

172
00:06:19,840 --> 00:06:20,980
是你在踢我
You're kicking me!

173
00:06:21,700 --> 00:06:24,000
对不起 我今天有些烦躁
I'm sorry. I'm just fidgety today.

174
00:06:24,420 --> 00:06:25,040
没关系
It's okay.

175
00:06:25,520 --> 00:06:26,500
吃块曲奇饼会有帮助
A cookie might help.

176
00:06:26,780 --> 00:06:28,000
这是你想要的纸巾
Here's that napkin you wanted.

177
00:06:28,260 --> 00:06:28,980
我拿了信
I got the mail!

178
00:06:29,100 --> 00:06:30,060
给我一张
Would it have killed you

179
00:06:30,060 --> 00:06:31,580
没沾番茄酱的纸巾你会死吗
to give me one without ketchup on it?

180
00:06:31,700 --> 00:06:32,140
走开
Move!

181
00:06:32,460 --> 00:06:33,540
你那边够宽敞了
You have room!

182
00:06:33,700 --> 00:06:35,260
不 搬走 你都40岁了
No, move out! You're 40!

183
00:06:35,260 --> 00:06:36,660
好了 够了
Okay. That's enough.

184
00:06:36,840 --> 00:06:38,360
卢克 你去给花园浇水吧
Luke, why don't you go water our garden.

185
00:06:38,640 --> 00:06:40,080
海莉 消失一会儿吧
Haley, just disappear for a minute.

186
00:06:40,080 --> 00:06:42,308
反正你也帮不上忙
Well, it's not like you could help with that.

187
00:06:42,465 --> 00:06:43,849
说到人家痛处了
Abracad-ouch.

188
00:06:44,620 --> 00:06:46,820
艾丽克斯回家了真好 对吧
Well, it's great having Alex home, huh?

189
00:06:46,840 --> 00:06:47,380
太棒了
So great.

190
00:06:47,900 --> 00:06:50,000
你不会觉得是她让我们...
You don't think that she's the reason why we --

191
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:51,200
不 我不觉得
No. No, I do not.

192
00:06:51,200 --> 00:06:52,940
我们都知道这个迷人的夏天
We both knew that this charmed summer

193
00:06:52,940 --> 00:06:54,160
迟早会遭遇不顺
had to have a bump in it somewhere.

194
00:06:54,460 --> 00:06:55,760
是啊
Yes. Yeah.

195
00:06:56,000 --> 00:06:57,580
艾丽克斯回家
And it's not like Alex coming home

196
00:06:57,580 --> 00:07:00,340
又不会让我们的快乐咒语顿时失效
could suddenly throw off our whole happy mojo.

197
00:07:01,320 --> 00:07:02,240
那李子好吃吗
How's that plum?

198
00:07:02,240 --> 00:07:03,980
挺好吃的 天呐
Great. Oh, my god.

199
00:07:06,028 --> 00:07:07,152
-她来了 -她来了
- There she is! - There she is!

200
00:07:07,152 --> 00:07:09,000
你回家真是太好了 亲爱的
Oh, so happy to have you home, honey.

201
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:10,120
天呐 是只蝙蝠
Oh, my god! It's a bat!

202
00:07:10,720 --> 00:07:11,580
怎么回事
What's happening?!

203
00:07:12,080 --> 00:07:13,360
把它弄出去
Get it out of house!

204
00:07:13,400 --> 00:07:14,600
弄出去
Get it away!

205
00:07:18,940 --> 00:07:20,240
难以置信
This is unbelievable.

206
00:07:20,440 --> 00:07:22,480
干洗工又搞丢了我的一件衬衣
The dry cleaner lost another one of my shirts.

207
00:07:22,660 --> 00:07:23,380
你知道那件好看的
You know that nice,

208
00:07:23,380 --> 00:07:24,500
红白蓝相间的夏威夷衬衣吧
red-white-and-blue Hawaiian one?

209
00:07:24,760 --> 00:07:26,420
是啊 那件真的不错
Yes, that was a very nice one.

210
00:07:26,460 --> 00:07:28,180
这是他搞丢的第四件夏威夷衬衣了
That's the fourth Hawaiian shirt he's lost.

211
00:07:28,260 --> 00:07:28,860
我告诉你
I'm telling you,

212
00:07:28,860 --> 00:07:30,880
这事要发展成罪案新闻报头条了
this is a "Dateline" story waiting to happen.

213
00:07:30,880 --> 00:07:32,760
跟你们大家聊天很开心
Great talking with you all,

214
00:07:32,920 --> 00:07:34,160
但有人想打个招呼
hey, but someone wants to say hi.

215
00:07:34,160 --> 00:07:34,603
不要
No, no!

216
00:07:34,603 --> 00:07:35,380
杰
Jay!

217
00:07:35,380 --> 00:07:36,900
大家好
Hi, guys.

218
00:07:37,400 --> 00:07:38,960
还是不会说西语
Nope, still don't speak Spanish.

219
00:07:39,160 --> 00:07:41,400
但是看到你们还是好高兴啊
Always so much fun seeing you guys, though.

220
00:07:41,820 --> 00:07:43,240
听着 我...
Listen, I --

221
00:07:43,379 --> 00:07:43,804
-歌洛莉亚 -怎么
- Gloria? - Hmm?

222
00:07:44,020 --> 00:07:45,540
你表弟穿着我的那件
Your cousin's wearing

223
00:07:45,540 --> 00:07:47,340
黑黄桃色相间的夏威夷衬衣
my black, yellow, and peach Hawaiian shirt.

224
00:07:47,607 --> 00:07:49,640
拜托 杰
Ay, please, Jay!

225
00:07:49,640 --> 00:07:50,800
好像全世界
Like you're the only man

226
00:07:50,800 --> 00:07:52,520
就你有那件衬衣一样
in this whole wide world that owns that shirt.

227
00:07:52,640 --> 00:07:53,840
这种独特的设计不仅会
These designer specs don't

228
00:07:53,840 --> 00:07:54,900
让我的眼睛显得很明亮
just make my eyes pop.

229
00:07:55,140 --> 00:07:57,780
我还能看见左边口袋上被雪茄烫的印迹
I can see the cigar burn I put on the left pocket.

230
00:07:58,680 --> 00:07:59,940
这是个巧合
It's a coincidence.

231
00:07:59,940 --> 00:08:01,200
还有很多衣服呢
There's a lot of those.

232
00:08:01,200 --> 00:08:02,700
比如说你叔叔的帽衫
Like according to your uncle's hoodie here,

233
00:08:02,700 --> 00:08:04,780
他穿的是我在布坎南高中的田径队队服
he was on my track team at Buchanan High.

234
00:08:04,780 --> 00:08:06,000
各位 这样吧
Hey, guys. Tell you what.

235
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:08,240
不如我们换换口味 尝尝美国食物
Why don't we sample some American food for a change?

236
00:08:09,140 --> 00:08:11,660
你把我的衣服寄去了哥伦比亚吗
So, you're sending my clothes to Colombia?

237
00:08:12,460 --> 00:08:14,420
只是旧衣服啦
Just the old ones, and --

238
00:08:14,420 --> 00:08:16,009
他们寄回来了大部分衣服
and they send most of them back.

239
00:08:16,009 --> 00:08:17,204
原来如此
And there it is.

240
00:08:17,420 --> 00:08:19,120
你对我的穿衣风格有意见吗
Do you have a problem with the way I dress?

241
00:08:19,300 --> 00:08:20,660
杰 我非常爱你
Jay, I love you very, very much.

242
00:08:20,680 --> 00:08:22,760
我也非常爱你 但我问的不是这个
And I love you very much, but that wasn't the question.

243
00:08:23,020 --> 00:08:25,180
只是有时候我觉得
It's just that sometimes I feel like

244
00:08:25,180 --> 00:08:28,020
你可以在穿着打扮上做出更大的努力
you could make a bigger effort on your appearance.

245
00:08:28,120 --> 00:08:28,800
你终于说了
And there it is.

246
00:08:29,060 --> 00:08:30,980
别再这么说了
Please stop saying that.

247
00:08:31,300 --> 00:08:33,380
我最近就是觉得
It's just that I feel that lately

248
00:08:33,380 --> 00:08:35,460
你不再用心为我打扮自己了
you don't make an effort to look good for me,

249
00:08:35,460 --> 00:08:37,900
但我从来都为你精心装扮自己的
and I'm always making an effort to look my best for you.

250
00:08:38,040 --> 00:08:39,280
为我吗 是嘛
For me? Sure.

251
00:08:39,640 --> 00:08:40,080
怎么了
What?

252
00:08:40,220 --> 00:08:42,280
我们直说吧 你不是在为我装扮自己
Well, let's face it, you don't really doll up for me --

253
00:08:42,280 --> 00:08:43,160
你是为了自己
you do it for you.

254
00:08:43,260 --> 00:08:44,920
你做头发 做指甲
You get your hair done, you get your nails done.

255
00:08:45,060 --> 00:08:47,940
所以我不打扮自己你也没问题吗
Oh, so you wouldn't mind if I stopped fixing myself up?

256
00:08:47,960 --> 00:08:49,980
没问题 因为我爱的是你
No, because I love you for you.

257
00:08:50,280 --> 00:08:51,480
既然我们要说实话
And since we're being honest,

258
00:08:51,480 --> 00:08:52,940
其实我有时认为
I actually think sometimes...

259
00:08:52,940 --> 00:08:54,240
你有点打扮过度了
you overdo it.

260
00:08:54,240 --> 00:08:56,140
你终于说了
And there it is.

261
00:08:56,180 --> 00:08:57,140
这句话不是这么用的
You're using it wrong.

262
00:08:57,140 --> 00:08:58,142
不 这很好
No, this is good.

263
00:08:58,142 --> 00:09:00,280
知道你一点也不在乎非常好
It's good to know that -- that you don't care.

264
00:09:00,280 --> 00:09:02,720
我以后可以节省很多时间了
This is gonna save me so much time in the future.

265
00:09:02,880 --> 00:09:03,140
很好
Good.

266
00:09:03,520 --> 00:09:03,820
很好
Good!

267
00:09:04,817 --> 00:09:07,180
曼尼
Manny!

268
00:09:07,180 --> 00:09:07,620
为什么
Why?

269
00:09:10,481 --> 00:09:11,720
我不管俗不俗气
I don't care if it's cliché?

270
00:09:11,720 --> 00:09:13,820
我就是很喜欢小乳蛋饼的便捷
I love the convenience of a nice mini quiche.

271
00:09:13,820 --> 00:09:15,200
你那里有一点
You got a little, um...

272
00:09:15,200 --> 00:09:17,280
不 好吧 好极了
Oh, no. Okay. Perfect.

273
00:09:17,280 --> 00:09:19,160
新人还能再尴尬一点吗
Can the new guy embarrass himself any more?

274
00:09:19,160 --> 00:09:20,280
大律师
Hey, counselor.

275
00:09:20,620 --> 00:09:23,140
我要怎么做你才能把外套脱掉呢
What do I have to do to get you to drop that suit?

276
00:09:23,140 --> 00:09:24,180
小卡 你怎么来了
Cam, what are you doing here?

277
00:09:24,180 --> 00:09:26,531
给我的"抱抱老公"惊喜啊
Surprising my "Hugsband"!

278
00:09:27,760 --> 00:09:29,380
这个词我还是第一次听说
I'm hearing that term for the first time.

279
00:09:29,380 --> 00:09:29,820
是啊
Yeah.

280
00:09:32,660 --> 00:09:34,060
你们什么时候回来
So when will you guys be back?

281
00:09:34,280 --> 00:09:36,160
看来有人准备要取悦女同胞了
Looks like somebody's entertaining a lady friend.

282
00:09:36,383 --> 00:09:40,260
也许你会给她斟一杯曼尼·施维滋美酒
Maybe you'll pour her a nice, tall glass of Manny-Schewitz?

283
00:09:40,260 --> 00:09:42,280
你知道吗 有时候直接回答问题比较好
You know what? Sometimes just a straight answer.

284
00:09:42,407 --> 00:09:45,050
歌洛莉亚 能给我个大概的时间吗
Gloria, can I get an E.T.A.?

285
00:09:45,200 --> 00:09:46,460
这些都是重要的客户
These are important clients.

286
00:09:46,460 --> 00:09:48,420
我希望我们到的时候他们还活着
I'd like them to still be alive when we get there.

287
00:09:48,520 --> 00:09:49,860
好了 我准备好了
Okay! I'm ready.

288
00:09:51,160 --> 00:09:51,800
真的吗
Seriously?

289
00:09:52,200 --> 00:09:52,540
怎么了
What?

290
00:09:54,078 --> 00:09:56,240
不 对不起
Ay, no! I'm so sorry!

291
00:09:56,240 --> 00:09:59,040
我忘了是要和你的客户喝东西
I forgot this was drinks with your clients.

292
00:09:59,220 --> 00:10:00,960
等等 好了
Hold on. Okay.

293
00:10:01,660 --> 00:10:04,100
我准备好了 走吧
I'm ready now. Let's go.

294
00:10:05,820 --> 00:10:07,280
你好呀 大明星
Hey, there, superstar.

295
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:08,860
白痴
Moron!

296
00:10:09,100 --> 00:10:09,440
蠢货
Derp!

297
00:10:09,440 --> 00:10:11,596
你不在的时候这里真是大不相同
It really hasn't been the same here without you.

298
00:10:11,880 --> 00:10:13,760
你在看什么呢
So what do you got there?

299
00:10:13,940 --> 00:10:15,240
大学宣传册
Oh, college brochure!

300
00:10:15,240 --> 00:10:17,400
你要选学校了
You're gonna have your pick of schools.

301
00:10:17,400 --> 00:10:19,180
你是我们的小天才
You're our little genius.

302
00:10:19,780 --> 00:10:21,480
我只是希望
I just hope --

303
00:10:21,640 --> 00:10:22,680
什么 克莱尔 你希望什么
What, Claire? What do you hope?

304
00:10:22,840 --> 00:10:24,820
你的记录那么完美
Well, you have such a perfect record,

305
00:10:24,820 --> 00:10:26,580
我希望他们不会给你不好的评价
I hope they don't hold it against you

306
00:10:26,580 --> 00:10:29,134
因为你这周确实
that this week you kinda... well...

307
00:10:29,600 --> 00:10:30,400
我不想用"半途而废"这个词
Don't want to say "Quit."

308
00:10:30,580 --> 00:10:31,580
你已经用了
You just did.

309
00:10:31,640 --> 00:10:33,340
你是想把我送回那个地狱吗
Are you trying to send me back to that hellhole?

310
00:10:33,340 --> 00:10:37,000
不 宝贝 你是团队的一部分
No! It's -- honey, you're part of a team,

311
00:10:37,000 --> 00:10:38,860
有人在指望着你呢
and there are people relying on you,

312
00:10:38,880 --> 00:10:41,220
所以当你像这样消失时
so when you just up and vanish like that,

313
00:10:41,220 --> 00:10:42,920
就好像
it sort of -- it --

314
00:10:42,920 --> 00:10:43,800
菲尔
Phil?

315
00:10:44,860 --> 00:10:45,260
菲尔
Phil?!

316
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:49,260
你妈妈只是觉得这不像你
Your mom just feels like it's unlike you

317
00:10:49,260 --> 00:10:50,280
你不是会撒手不管的人
to walk away from something.

318
00:10:50,360 --> 00:10:51,780
至少我还能离开
At least I could walk away.

319
00:10:51,980 --> 00:10:53,900
跟我住一个帐篷的人把脚钉在了地板上
My tent-mate nail-gunned her foot to the floor.

320
00:10:53,993 --> 00:10:56,300
她就那样一边原地打转一边叫
She was just walking around in a circle screaming

321
00:10:56,300 --> 00:10:57,600
直到有人发现了她
until someone found her!

322
00:10:57,740 --> 00:10:59,460
为什么你们这么想赶我走
Why do you guys want to get rid of me so badly?

323
00:10:59,500 --> 00:11:00,740
没人想赶你走
No one wants to get rid of you.

324
00:11:00,820 --> 00:11:01,900
只不过是再呆七天
It's just seven more days.

325
00:11:01,900 --> 00:11:03,880
善始善终会让你感觉很好的
You'll feel good about finishing something you started,

326
00:11:03,880 --> 00:11:05,500
然后你就可以跟我们一起度过
and then you join us for the perfect little summer

327
00:11:05,500 --> 00:11:06,360
这完美的夏天了
we're having here.

328
00:11:06,360 --> 00:11:08,620
直到一小时前都很完美
Were having until an hour ago.

329
00:11:08,620 --> 00:11:08,980
海莉
Haley!

330
00:11:09,380 --> 00:11:11,000
天呐 好吧 我懂了
Oh, my god. Okay, I see what this is.

331
00:11:11,000 --> 00:11:12,580
我不在你们都会高兴一点
You all are happier when I'm not here.

332
00:11:12,740 --> 00:11:13,540
不 不是这样的
No, that's not true.

333
00:11:13,720 --> 00:11:14,060
省省吧
Save it!

334
00:11:14,120 --> 00:11:15,180
我会搭车回去的
I'll get a ride back up there

335
00:11:15,180 --> 00:11:16,540
然后你们所有人就能继续
and you all can continue to enjoy

336
00:11:16,540 --> 00:11:18,320
享受你们完美的小夏天了
your perfect, little summer!

337
00:11:18,320 --> 00:11:19,976
-艾丽克斯 宝贝 -别理我
- Alex, honey! - Leave me alone!

338
00:11:21,880 --> 00:11:23,680
电影台免费了
We just got free Cinemax!

339
00:11:28,520 --> 00:11:30,480
这是米奇尔在亲一只海豚
Here's Mitchell kissing a dolphin.

340
00:11:31,280 --> 00:11:32,800
这是他在亲一只老虎
Oh, that's him kissing a tiger.

341
00:11:33,220 --> 00:11:34,000
我就是那只老虎
I'm the tiger.

342
00:11:35,740 --> 00:11:38,700
我们太开心了
We have fun, you know?

343
00:11:38,700 --> 00:11:40,775
我们可以带配偶来的吗
Were we supposed to bring our spouses?

344
00:11:40,775 --> 00:11:42,295
小卡 小卡 听着
Hey, Cam? Cam, hey, look.

345
00:11:42,295 --> 00:11:44,620
这活动只限员工参加
Um, this is kind of work-only.

346
00:11:44,620 --> 00:11:46,440
拜托 他们都没发现我在这
Oh, please. They don't even know I'm here.

347
00:11:46,600 --> 00:11:47,960
我喜欢这首歌 我们跳舞吧
I love this song. Let's dance.

348
00:11:47,960 --> 00:11:49,335
不 不 没有人跳舞
No, no. Nobody's -- nobody's dancing.

349
00:11:49,335 --> 00:11:50,531
用屁股来交流吧
Shh. Say it with your hips.

350
00:11:51,176 --> 00:11:52,551
好吧
O-kay.

351
00:11:52,618 --> 00:11:54,173
别这样 小卡
Hey, uh, no, Cam. Um...

352
00:11:54,420 --> 00:11:56,640
你知道我爱你 对吧
You know I love you, right?

353
00:11:56,800 --> 00:11:58,680
第一个用正确的方式爱我的人
First man that ever did love me right!

354
00:11:58,680 --> 00:11:59,600
我们很开心
We have fun.

355
00:11:59,660 --> 00:12:00,840
确实是 我们是的
We do, we do, we do.

356
00:12:00,840 --> 00:12:03,860
所以 我在想 也许
Um, so, look, I-I was thinking that maybe...

357
00:12:03,860 --> 00:12:05,960
我们可以把浪漫行为减少一点
we could turn the romance down

358
00:12:05,960 --> 00:12:07,480
就一点点
just a little bit, you know?

359
00:12:07,480 --> 00:12:08,920
因为这些事变得有点
Because it's been getting a little bit --

360
00:12:08,920 --> 00:12:12,160
我不想说是过分了 但是
I-I-I don't want to say over the top, but it --

361
00:12:12,639 --> 00:12:13,597
好吧 如果你想继续跳舞的话
Okay, I'm gonna need your help

362
00:12:13,597 --> 00:12:14,913
我需要你也动起来
if we're gonna keep dancing here.

363
00:12:15,140 --> 00:12:16,000
我感觉到你生气了
I feel like you're mad.

364
00:12:19,848 --> 00:12:21,400
我们搞了个非正式的投票
So, we had an informal vote over there...

365
00:12:21,400 --> 00:12:22,320
我们没有在跳舞了
We're not dancing anymore.

366
00:12:22,460 --> 00:12:23,220
那就好
Oh, good.

367
00:12:26,200 --> 00:12:28,400
你知道赫布可能会来的 对吧
You know Herb might stop by, right?

368
00:12:28,580 --> 00:12:30,840
他给公司新闻简报拍照配图
He takes the pictures for the company newsletter.

369
00:12:30,980 --> 00:12:32,620
知道 我很喜欢看《赫布宣传报》
Yes, I love "Herb's blurbs."

370
00:12:33,680 --> 00:12:34,240
好了
Well...

371
00:12:34,455 --> 00:12:37,368
到大门了
Here come the doors!

372
00:12:37,980 --> 00:12:40,240
