is what I feel when you stop trying to look good for me.

384
00:13:03,460 --> 00:13:04,520
我知道的
No, I get it.

385
00:13:04,860 --> 00:13:06,480
那你为什么不打扮了
Then why did you stop trying?

386
00:13:09,340 --> 00:13:09,780
因为
Because...

387
00:13:09,780 --> 00:13:11,440
算了吧 理由太蠢了
Oh, forget it. It's too stupid.

388
00:13:12,060 --> 00:13:12,940
告诉我
Tell me.

389
00:13:14,160 --> 00:13:15,500
几个月以前
A couple of months ago,

390
00:13:15,815 --> 00:13:17,540
我在巴尼百货店买衣服
I was shopping at Barneys --

391
00:13:17,540 --> 00:13:18,780
你知道我喜欢赶时髦
you know I like to stay current.

392
00:13:19,560 --> 00:13:21,500
当我走出更衣室的时候
Anyhow, I'm coming out of the dressing room,

393
00:13:21,500 --> 00:13:24,860
