and I see these two young guys laughing at me,

394
00:13:24,860 --> 00:13:27,080
像是在说"一把年纪了还赶时髦"
you know, like "There's the old guy trying too hard."

395
00:13:27,080 --> 00:13:28,380
我当然很生气了
You know, of course I get mad.

396
00:13:28,600 --> 00:13:29,380
可我却开始觉得
But I start thinking,

397
00:13:29,380 --> 00:13:30,100
他们说得没错 杰
"They're right, Jay.

398
00:13:30,100 --> 00:13:32,260
你老了 就别装嫩了
You're old. Just be old."

399
00:13:33,580 --> 00:13:34,720
