420
00:14:18,660 --> 00:14:19,660
他不爱我
He loves me not...

421
00:14:20,020 --> 00:14:21,000
他不爱我
He loves me not...

422
00:14:21,000 --> 00:14:22,360
他不爱我
He loves me not.

