不行 我有点忙
Actually, no. I'm kind of busy.

425
00:14:25,966 --> 00:14:28,840
你大概忘了今天是我们结婚三周月
I'm assuming you forgot it's our three month-iversary.

426
00:14:28,840 --> 00:14:31,480
我傻不拉几地布置了一番
Well, I foolishly set up a celebration

427
