不过放心 我会清理掉的
that I will kindly get rid of.

428
00:14:33,480 --> 00:14:33,860
小卡
Cam!

429
00:14:34,960 --> 00:14:36,480
不 我没忘
No, I didn't forget,

430
00:14:36,480 --> 00:14:38,340
但我想跟你说的就是这个
but that's what I want to talk to you about.

431
00:14:38,440 --> 00:14:39,900
你有点太
You've been a little bit --

432
00:14:39,900 --> 00:14:41,600
瞧 这就是我要说的
