471
00:15:56,320 --> 00:15:58,060
连你也得承认这有点过分了吧
Even you have to admit this is excessive.

472
00:15:58,360 --> 00:15:59,320
过分 你真这么觉得
Excessive? Really?

473
00:16:00,380 --> 00:16:02,460
你被丘比特的神箭射中了
Struck by Cupid's magic arrow.

474
00:16:02,460 --> 00:16:03,588
结束了 莉莉
It's off, Lily.

475
00:16:03,880 --> 00:16:06,540
不是吧 跟罗莎排练了两个小时呢
Seriously? Two hours rehearsing with Rosa?

476
00:16:07,060 --> 00:16:09,180
小卡 你到底怎么了
Cam, what is going on with you?

477
00:16:09,180 --> 00:16:12,320
我们刚刚经历了最浪漫的一年
We just had the most romantic year ever,

478
00:16:12,400 --> 00:16:15,120
策划了我们的纪念日 婚礼还有蜜月
planning our ceremony, the wedding, the honeymoon,

479
00:16:15,680 --> 00:16:17,740
我担心一旦松懈下来
and I'm just worried if we let this go,

480
00:16:17,740 --> 00:16:18,780
我们就再也浪漫不起来了
we'll never get it back.

481
00:16:18,900 --> 00:16:21,060
这些又不会就这么结束了
Well, that doesn't all just end.

482
00:16:21,120 --> 00:16:21,840
已经发生过一次了
It did once.

483
00:16:22,340 --> 00:16:23,960
我们刚住在一起的前两年
You know, the first two years we were together,

484
