495
00:16:45,080 --> 00:16:47,860
试着变得浪漫些
tried to become a little bit more romantic?

496
00:16:48,040 --> 00:16:49,500
那会是什么样呢
What would that even look like?

497
00:16:51,320 --> 00:16:53,520
听这歌 听这歌
This song... this song...

498
00:16:53,520 --> 00:16:56,980
是我向你提出同居那晚放的歌
Was playing the night I asked you to move in.

499
00:16:57,215 --> 00:16:58,830
在苹果蜜餐厅
At that Applebee's.

500
00:16:59,660 --> 00:17:01,180
你还欠我一支舞呢
I believe you owe me a dance.

501
00:17:01,540 --> 00:17:01,840
是的
Yes.

502
00:17:09,280 --> 00:17:11,840
这戏演完了没
Are we almost done with fairy time?

503
00:17:11,840 --> 00:17:13,220
-莉莉别这样 -莉莉 这很没礼貌
- Lily, of all... - Lily, that's offensive.

504
00:17:13,220 --> 00:17:14,980
我只是想换掉这身衣服
I just want to get out of this costume.

505
00:17:14,980 --> 00:17:16,468
这样啊 当然可以了
Oh. Oh, of course.

506
00:17:16,468 --> 00:17:17,560
这衣服看着确实不舒服
Now, that does look uncomfortable.

507
00:17:17,560 --> 00:17:17,960
可以直接扯下来
They snap off.

508
00:17:18,020 --> 00:17:19,400
扯下来就好 小意思
They snap off. Oh, that's easy.

509
00:17:20,340 --> 00:17:21,200
马上就有人来接我了
My ride's on its way.

510
00:17:21,360 --> 00:17:22,900
别担心 我会在屋外等
Don't worry, I'll wait outside on the curb.

511
00:17:23,020 --> 00:17:24,160
宝贝 没人赶你走
Honey, nobody wants you to go.

512
00:17:24,260 --> 00:17:26,680
哪怕你真的是灾星 也是我们的灾星
Yeah, even if you are bad luck, you're our bad luck.

513
00:17:26,840 --> 00:17:29,040
你这话算哪门子道歉
You realize that is in no way an apology, right?

514
00:17:29,080 --> 00:17:30,380
关键是 我们真的
The thing is that we are really --

515
00:17:30,380 --> 00:17:30,620
别说了
