516
00:17:30,720 --> 00:17:32,660
我这个夏天到哪儿都是外人
I spent this entire summer as an outsider.

517
00:17:32,780 --> 00:17:35,520
就连建房子 他们也是让我修外墙
They literally made me build the outside of the house.

518
