我关掉网页时
It doesn't automatically turn off

523
00:17:44,120 --> 00:17:45,460
摄像头不会自动关掉吗
when you go to a different web page?

524
00:17:45,460 --> 00:17:48,460
不会 想想你把电脑放在床上
No, and considering you keep your laptop on your bed,

525
00:17:48,460 --> 00:17:49,640
看得到你换衣服
right by where you change,

526
00:17:49,640 --> 00:17:50,840
看得到你洗澡出来
and when you come out of the shower,

527
00:17:50,840 --> 00:17:52,060
谁知道还能看到啥
and who knows what else...

528
00:17:52,360 --> 00:17:53,580
大家都知道能看到啥
Everyone knows what else!

529
00:17:53,720 --> 00:17:55,820
难怪你有五万个订阅者
It's probably why you have 50,000 subscribers.

530
00:17:56,300 --> 00:17:58,700
你们真应该感到羞愧
Hey! You should be ashamed of yourselves!

531
00:18:00,500 --> 00:18:01,760
好啦 好啦 还开着的
Yeah, yeah. Still not off.

532
00:18:02,160 --> 00:18:03,220
你怎么关的
How do you do that?

533
00:18:03,220 --> 00:18:05,000
慢着 有股味道
Wait, what is that smell?

534
00:18:05,160 --> 00:18:07,560
你爸和卢克在做大黄派
Your father and luke are making a rhubarb pie

535
00:18:07,560 --> 00:18:09,360
用的我们自家种的大黄
from rhubarb we grew in our own garden.

536
00:18:09,460 --> 00:18:10,640
你走之前一定要尝尝
You're not leaving until you try it.

537
