不不不 是烟味
No, no, no, no, no. I smell smoke.

538
00:18:12,340 --> 00:18:13,900
我还没开烤炉呢
Well, I didn't turn the oven on yet.

539
00:18:13,900 --> 00:18:14,260
你开了吗
Did you?

540
00:18:14,600 --> 00:18:14,900
还没
No.

541
00:18:14,900 --> 00:18:16,013
完了 完了
Oh, no, no!

542
00:18:16,013 --> 00:18:18,360
我昨晚泡澡时打算看《战争与和平》的
I tried to start that stupid "War and Peace" again

543
00:18:18,360 --> 00:18:20,320
结果在浴缸里睡着了
last night in the bathtub, but then I fell asleep.

544
00:18:20,420 --> 00:18:21,240
书掉进了水里
It dropped in the water

545
00:18:21,240 --> 00:18:22,821
我想着把它烘干
and I thought I would just dry it out.

546
00:18:23,280 --> 00:18:23,960
快躲开
Take cover!

547
00:18:23,960 --> 00:18:25,607
-好 好 -快躲开
- Okay! Okay! - Take cover!

548
00:18:25,720 --> 00:18:26,580
天哪
Oh, god!

549
00:18:27,315 --> 00:18:28,280
破烂玩意儿
Damn this thing!

550
00:18:28,280 --> 00:18:29,640
没人看见烤炉亮着灯吗
Did nobody notice the oven light?!

551
00:18:29,640 --> 00:18:30,920
同志们 指示灯是有意义的
Lights mean things, people!

552
00:18:32,980 --> 00:18:33,660
漂亮
Great job!

553
00:18:33,660 --> 00:18:35,960
天哪 完了 完了
Oh, god! Oh, no! No! No!

554
00:18:35,960 --> 00:18:37,060
干得漂亮 宝贝
Good job, honey!

