00:18:38,700 --> 00:18:40,820
玩得真爽 但我的车到了
This has been awesome, but my ride's here.

556
00:18:40,820 --> 00:18:41,440
祝你们玩得开心
Have a magical day.

557
00:18:41,440 --> 00:18:42,420
别走 别走
No, no, no, no.

