00:18:43,277 --> 00:18:44,471
-克莱尔 让我说 -好
- Claire, I got this. - Okay.

560
00:18:44,471 --> 00:18:45,120
各位 吃一口
Spoon time, people.

561
00:18:45,120 --> 00:18:46,460
好 我们家的传统
Yes! Family tradition.

562
00:18:46,460 --> 00:18:47,040
好
Yes.

563
00:18:47,040 --> 00:18:49,080
听着 宝贝 你想走可以走
Look, you can leave if you want to, sweetheart,

564
00:18:49,080 --> 00:18:52,000
但我们得让你高高兴兴地走
but we're not letting you go without a smile on your face.

565
00:18:52,640 --> 00:18:54,400
这里面满满都是我和卢克的爱
Luke and I poured a lot of love into this pie,

566
00:18:54,400 --> 00:18:55,680
来
so, here...

567
00:18:56,000 --> 00:18:57,260
尝一口
Taste this.

568
00:18:57,920 --> 00:18:58,760
尝尝我们的爱
Taste our love.

569
00:18:58,760 --> 00:19:01,140
你们把大黄的叶子去掉了吧
You took the leaves off the rhubarb, right?

570
00:19:02,040 --> 00:19:03,960
叶子可是有毒的 会毒死你们的
They're incredibly poisonous. You all could die.

571
00:19:03,960 --> 00:19:06,426
别吃 艾丽克斯说它有毒
No! Alex says they're poison!

572
00:19:08,457 --> 00:19:10,180
我们也听见了
We're right here! We heard her!

573
00:19:10,180 --> 00:19:11,260
你不能离开我们
You can't leave us.

574
00:19:11,660 --> 00:19:12,780
不然我们会害死自己的
We're a danger to ourselves.

575
00:19:13,320 --> 00:19:14,500
我们这家子有玩火的
We're a family of fire starters,

576
00:19:14,640 --> 00:19:16,120
有吃毒药的 还有上网卖淫的
poison eaters, and online prostitutes.

577
00:19:16,440 --> 00:19:17,920
这不是个完美的夏天
It wasn't a perfect summer.

578
00:19:18,080 --> 00:19:19,820
是个愚蠢的夏天
It was a stupid summer.

579
00:19:20,040 --> 00:19:21,560
没有你在旁边取笑我
Without you here to shame me,

580
00:19:21,560 --> 00:19:23,820
我已堕落到看完全部《贵妇的真实生活》
I watched every "Real Housewives" episode

581
00:19:23,820 --> 00:19:26,440
正经书却才看了两页
and I only got to page two in "War and Peace."

582
00:19:26,440 --> 00:19:27,320
求你别走
Please stay.

583
00:19:27,620 --> 00:19:29,560
我们家至少需要一个大人
We need at least one adult in this household.

584
00:19:30,680 --> 00:19:31,460
好吧
Okay, fine.

585
00:19:33,954 --> 00:19:35,660
你们知道天窗没关吧
You know the attic window is open, right?

586
00:19:35,660 --> 00:19:36,440
还真不知道
We really didn't.

587
00:19:39,727 --> 00:19:41,020
我们看谁先爬上楼
I race you up the stairs.

588
00:19:41,020 --> 00:19:42,980
先去换件漂亮衣服吧
Why don't you slip into something less comfortable?

589
00:19:42,980 --> 00:19:43,827
好
Okay!

590
00:19:44,273 --> 00:19:46,134
惊喜哦
Surprise! Surprise! Surprise! Surprise!

591
00:19:47,400 --> 00:19:50,220
我觉得 我们以后是不是别玩惊吓了
Just a thought -- maybe we should stop doing these.

592
00:19:50,280 --> 00:19:51,060
你们搞什么
What's going on?

593
00:19:51,300 --> 00:19:52,320
这还看不出来吗
It seems pretty obvious.

594
00:19:52,480 --> 00:19:53,860
我故意把派对提前了一星期
I had to throw the party a week early

595
00:19:53,860 --> 00:19:54,820
好真的给她一个惊喜
to really surprise her.

596
00:19:54,820 --> 00:19:56,380
我们该担心吗
Should we be concerned about her?

597
00:19:56,540 --> 00:19:58,180
当年老妈就是这么一走了之的
That's kind of similar to the way mom left.

598
00:19:58,560 --> 00:20:00,920
歌洛莉亚和我在穿着打扮上闹别扭
Gloria and I got in this whole thing about how we dress.

599
00:20:01,160 --> 00:20:01,780
说来话长
Long story,

600
00:20:01,820 --> 00:20:03,320
我估计她要花点时间打扮一下
I think she might need a little more time bef--

601
00:20:04,940 --> 00:20:05,340
大家好
Hola!

602
00:20:08,720 --> 00:20:10,280
我里面穿着这身衣服呢
I had this outfit underneath.

603
00:20:10,400 --> 00:20:11,240
你不会真以为
Did you really think

604
00:20:11,240 --> 00:20:13,320
我会穿成那样进酒吧吧
that I was gonna walk into a bar looking like that?

605
00:20:14,440 --> 00:20:14,840
谢谢
Gracias!

606
00:20:16,280 --> 00:20:17,420
这些年害我好苦啊
All these years,

607
00:20:17,420 --> 00:20:19,320
原来你瞬间就能打扮好啊
You're telling me you can get ready that fast?

608
00:20:35,300 --> 00:20:37,820
加勒比女王
Caribbean queen

609
00:20:38,720 --> 00:20:40,500
我们分享着...
Now we're sharing the --

610
00:20:56,040 --> 00:20:57,680
天哪真好吃
Oh, my god!
